28:{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/cynozure-logo.svg","mediaDetails":"$29"}
26:{"text":"What a cracking result we’ve ended up with….the effort was well worth it and we couldn’t be happier with the outcome. Thanks for all your work, efforts and energy on this. ","backgroundColor":"#f6e6cd","name":"Cynozure","speciality":null,"button":"$27","logo":"$28"}
2b:{"title":"View project","url":"https://kota.co.uk/work/optomen/","target":""}
2a:{"text":"KOTA were an absolute joy to work with. As well as being incredibly creative, they were extremely easy to talk to and always took the time to explain things clearly to us. They were also very patient, as we would regularly change our minds about things at the last minute. We are extremely happy with the finished products and would recommend them to anyone looking for a beautiful, easy to use website.","backgroundColor":"#c1b7f0","name":"Optomen","speciality":null,"button":"$2b","logo":null}
2d:{"title":"View project","url":"https://kota.co.uk/work/hassan-allam/","target":""}
2c:{"text":"I had an outstanding experience working with Kota. Their team's expertise and dedication were truly impressive. Kota's project management was top-notch, and they met all the deadlines, ensuring a smooth and successful launch. Their technical skills and creativity exceeded our expectations, and we are delighted with the final result. I wholeheartedly recommend Kota for anyone seeking a reliable and talented web development partner. Five stars, without a doubt!","backgroundColor":"#e7b6d7","name":"Hassan Allam","speciality":null,"button":"$2d","logo":null}
25:["$26","$2a","$2c"]
