holeheartedly recommend Kota for anyone seeking a reliable and talented web development partner. Five stars, without a doubt!","backgroundColor":"#e7b6d7","name":"Hassan Allam","speciality":null,"button":{"title":"View project","url":"https://kota.co.uk/work/hassan-allam/","target":""},"logo":null}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Testimonials_testimonialMobile__OUUvi","children":["$","$L24",null,{"testimonials":"$25"}]}]]}],"$L2e","$L2f"]}]]
